{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_1","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"南面京官","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_2","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"遼有五京。上京為皇都，凡朝官、京官皆有之；餘四京隨宜設官，為制不一。大抵西京多邊防官，南京、中京多財賦官。五京並置者，列陳之；特置者，分列于後。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_3","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"三京宰相府職名總目：","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_4","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"左相。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_5","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"右相。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_6","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"左平章政事。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_7","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"右平章政事。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_8","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"東京宰相府。聖宗統和元年，詔三京左右相、左右平章事。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_9","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"中京宰相府。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_10","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"南京宰相府。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_11","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"諸京內省客省職名總目：","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_12","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"某京某省使。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_13","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"某京某省副使。耶律蒲奴，開泰末為上京內客省副使。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_14","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"上京內省司。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_15","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"東京內省司。地理志，東京大內不置宮嬪，唯以內省使、副、判官守之。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_16","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"五京諸使職名總目：","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_17","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"某京某使。王棠，重熙中為上京鹽鐵使。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_18","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"知某京某使事。張孝傑，清寧間知戶部使事。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_19","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"某京某副使。劉伸，重熙中為三司副使。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_20","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"同知某京某使事。道宗大康三年見撻不也同知度支使事。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_21","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"某京某判官。聖宗太平九年見戶部使判官。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_22","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"上京鹽鐵使司。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_23","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"東京戶部使司。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_24","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"中京度支使司。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_25","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"南京三司使司。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_26","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"南京轉運使司。亦曰燕京轉運使司。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_27","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"西京計司。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_28","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"五京留守司兼府尹職名總目：","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_29","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"某京留守行某府尹事。聖宗統和元年見上京留守、行臨潢尹事吳王稍。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_30","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"某京副留守。天祚天慶六年見東京副留守高清臣。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_31","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"知某京留守事。蕭惠，開泰二年知東京留守事。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_32","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"某府少尹。聖宗太平四年見臨潢少尹鄭弘節。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_33","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"同知某京留守事。太平八年見中京同知耶律野。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_34","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"同簽某京留守事。蕭滴冽，太平六年同簽南京留守事。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_35","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"某京留守判官。室昉，天祿中為南京留守判官。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_36","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"某京留守推官。聖宗開泰元年見中京留守推官李可舉。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_37","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"上京留守司。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_38","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"東京留守司。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_39","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"中京留守司。太宗大同元年命趙延壽為中京留守，治鎮州。聖宗統和十二年命室昉為中京留守，治大定府。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_40","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"南京留守司。太宗天顯三年升東平郡為南京，治遼陽。十三年以幽州為南京，治析津。聖宗開泰元年改幽都府為析津府。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_41","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"西京留守司。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_42","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"五京都總管府職名總目：","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_43","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"某京都總管、知某府事。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_44","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"同知某府事。聖宗太平五年見同知中京事蕭堯袞。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_45","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"上京都總管府。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_46","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"東京都總管府。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_47","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"中京都總管府。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_48","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"南京都總管府。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_49","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"西京都總管府。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_50","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"五京都虞候司職名總目：","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_51","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"都虞候。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_52","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"上京都虞候司。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_53","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"東京都虞候司。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_54","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"南京都虞候司。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_55","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"西京都虞候司。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_56","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"中京都虞候司。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_57","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"五京警巡院職名總目：","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_58","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"某京警巡使。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_59","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"某京警巡副使。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_60","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"上京警巡院。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_61","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"東京警巡院。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_62","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"中京警巡院。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_63","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"南京警巡院。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_64","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"西京警巡院。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_65","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"五京處置使司職名總目：","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_66","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"某京處置使。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_67","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"上京處置司。","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_68","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"東京處置司。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_69","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"中京處置司。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_70","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"西京處置司。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_71","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"南京處置司。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_72","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"五京學職名總目：道宗清寧五年，詔設學養士，頒經及傳疏，置傅士、助教各一員。","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_73","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"博士。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_74","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"助教。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_75","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"上京學。上京別有國子監，見朝官。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_76","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"東京學。","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_77","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"中京學。中京別有國子監，與朝官同。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_78","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"南京學。亦曰南京太學，太宗置。聖宗統和十三年，賜水磑莊一區。","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_79","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"西京學。","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_80","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"已上五京官。","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_81","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"上京城隍使司。亦曰上京皇城使。","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_82","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"上京城隍使。韓德讓，景宗時為上京皇城使。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_83","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"東京渤海承奉官。聖宗開泰八年耶律八哥奏，渤海承奉班宜設官以統之，因置。","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_84","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"渤海承奉都知押班。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_85","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"遼陽大都督府。太宗會同二年置。","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_86","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"遼陽大都督。會同二年，都督曷魯泊等關防遼陽東都。","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_87","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"東京安撫使司。","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_88","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"東京安撫使。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_89","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"東京軍巡院。地理志，東京有歸化營軍千餘人，籍河朔亡命於此，置軍巡院。","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_90","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"東京軍巡使。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_91","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"中京文思院。","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_92","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"中京文思使。馬人望父佺為中京文思使。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_93","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"中京路按問使司。","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_94","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"中京路按問使。耶律和尚，重熙二十四年為中京路按問使。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_95","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"中京巡邏使司。","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_96","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"中京巡邏使。耶律古昱，開泰間為中京巡邏使。","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_97","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"中京大內都部署司。","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_98","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"中京大內都部署。聖宗開泰元年見中京大內都部署。","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_99","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"中京大內副部署。","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_100","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"南京宣徽院。","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_101","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"南京宣徽使。道宗壽隆元年見宣徽使耶律特末。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_102","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"知南京宣徽院使事。","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_103","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"知南京宣徽院事。","sentenceOrder":103},{"i