erId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"同知興中府事。","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_139","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"興中府判官。","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_140","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"興中府學。","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_141","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"博士。","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_142","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"助教。","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_143","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"南面方州官","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_144","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"遼東、西，燕、秦、漢、唐已置郡縣，設官職矣。高麗、渤海因之。至遼，五京列峙，包括燕、代，悉為畿甸。二百餘年，城郭相望，田野益闢。冠以節度，承以觀察、防禦、團練等使，分以刺史、縣令，大略採用唐制。其間宗室、外戚、大臣之家築城賜額，謂之「頭下州軍」；唯節度使朝廷命之，後往往皆歸王府。不能州者謂之軍，不能縣者謂之城，不能城者謂之堡。其設官則未詳云。","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_145","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"節度使職名總目：","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_146","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"某州某軍節度使。","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_147","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"某州某軍節度副使。","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_148","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"同知節度使事。耶律玦，重熙中同知遼興軍節度使事。","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_149","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"行軍司馬。","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_150","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"軍事判官。","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_151","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"掌書記。劉伸，重熙五年為彰武軍節度使掌書記。","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_152","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"衙官。","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_153","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48","textTraditional":"某馬步軍都指揮使司。","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_48_154","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_48